WEBVTT

00:06.600 --> 00:08.000
Issue orders.

00:09.120 --> 00:10.520
Summon General Zu.

00:10.880 --> 00:12.280
Yes.

00:16.160 --> 00:18.667
Your servant pays respects to Your Majesty.

00:23.480 --> 00:26.800
Your Majesty's wound is it better?

00:27.160 --> 00:31.760
I am well I summoned you today to discuss important matters.

00:32.640 --> 00:37.200
Now that all directions are settled I must consider Xuan Kingdom's future.

00:39.280 --> 00:40.680
For Xuan Kingdom's state.

00:41.440 --> 00:46.040
What do you think I should pass this throne to whom?

00:55.520 --> 01:00.893
Since ancient times if there's a legitimate heir, establish the legitimate heir if no legitimate heir, establish the eldest.

01:01.600 --> 01:03.000
I understand.

